+| Not applied control | 1 | `C-not-applied`, classified `NOT_APPLIED`; not evidence of a kill. |
+| Compile-failure control | 1 | `C-compile-failure`, classified `COMPILE_OR_HARNESS_FAILURE`; not evidence of a kill. |
