+
+Authority: `agent-session-manager-spec` v0.6.0, commit
+`0cbdf100dbf84df50c64f792b1f940e3a67859a6`; historical compatibility scope is
+v0.5.0, commit `28bf96d7dd7ebf3cd9e2ccd91d35b8660699dd5c`.
